[thin] Required 2.0 mm nominal spring wall selected for the production flexure. The reading lies on the hook and posed leaf, with the tangent root and 22.25 mm root-to-catch span. These complete walls have local solid infill in the retained native projects. This is the explicitly thinner flexure, not an ordinary enclosure wall or residual fin. Force, distributed bending and life require the complete paired physical check.
alternatives: A thicker leaf repeats the reported corner-only bending problem. Filling the spring corridor prevents inward travel. The connected full-Y sample retains both production wings and their matched receivers, with only the non-snap center shortened.
